{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-1","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接相似多边形面积比等于直径平方比","englishTitle":"Similar polygons inscribed in circles are to one another as the squares on the diameters.","book":12,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","contentId":"euclid-12-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae9941b56cd1b573466688b2cbedefffa692ce6061b0b8bc894e6e3993b373e2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-1.statement","euclid-12-1.construction.1","euclid-12-1.construction.2","euclid-12-1.proof.1","euclid-12-1.proof.2","euclid-12-1.proof.3","euclid-12-1.proof.4","euclid-12-1.proof.5","euclid-12-1.proof.6","euclid-12-1.proof.7","euclid-12-1.proof.8","euclid-12-1.conclusion","euclid-12-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2a84d2130d0ebe4467a0eee8d1769e6a06888795364f3bc18ccb5434f5abc23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar polygons inscribed in circles are to one another as the squares on the diameters."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"类似多边形个圆圈的圆形 与直径的正方形个相近"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4212df05588cf554696be635fbd3d8926b945f8ccf544a847f19e57e6d0a072f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, FGH be circles, let ABCDE, FGHKL be similar polygons inscribed in them, and let BM, GN be diameters of the circles; I say that, as the square on BM is to the square on GN, so is the polygon ABCDE to the polygon FGHKL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,FGH成为圆圈,让ABCDE,FGHKL成为类似多边形的圆圈,让BM,GN成为圆圈的直径;我说,BM,正方形与GN,正方形的比等于多边形,ABCDE与多边形,FGHKL的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15a58f5a97bd19ce5f01ad0cae10205193b80ff1337673f1a05bb20af829aaa0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BE, AM, GL, FN be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BE,AM,GL,FN连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c18c58de624f58e10bd659dbcb0a163ca490224e7f4691c95029480b9d8b09e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the polygon ABCDE is similar to the polygon FGHKL, the angle BAE is equal to the angle GFL, and, as BA is to AE, so is GF to FL. [VI. Def. I]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于多边形 ABCDE与多边形 FGHKL相似,BAE角等于GFL角,BA-AE比等于GF-FL比。 [VI. Def.I]；BA 与 AE 之比等于 GF 与 FL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07d3455274eb65472028a0a642438db3aa32696fd84c80466dd64d38e9f533d4","citations":["euclid-6-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus BAE, GFL are two triangles which have one angle equal to one angle, namely the angle BAE to the angle GFL, and the sides about the equal angles proportional; therefore the triangle ABE is equiangular with the triangle FGL. [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BAE,GFL是两个三角形,一个角度等于一个角度,即角BAE至角GFL,两边等于角成比例;因此,三角形ABE是三角形FGL的等角。 [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96f6daa6329dd43e3d87f767a8a2eed0a2691e1665ca75f3f8a208b463eae8b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle AEB is equal to the angle FLG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AEB角等于FLG角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75cf7c52bcf120b428dcb8fc281b0b0d80227a85aa40637dd3c79a919c8ab62e","citations":["euclid-3-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle AEB is equal to the angle AMB, for they stand on the same circumference; [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)] and the angle FLG to the angle FNG; therefore the angle AMB is also equal to the angle FNG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AEB角度等于AMB角度,因为它们处于同一环形上;FLG角度与FNG角度相同;因此,AMB角度也等于FNG角度。 [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc7af298c7b027683a31f6aed6cd28d884994d6b0e5af888201866265ad979b7","citations":["euclid-3-31","euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the right angle BAM is also equal to the right angle GFN; [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)] therefore the remaining angle is equal to the remaining angle. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,直角 BAM也等于直角 GFN;因此,剩余角度等于剩余角度。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cdd23643b0706ccbc49b9bfcf1a59cebd2f4afd9c62bbba7ec70fbfecf2e2c61","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABM is equiangular with the triangle FGN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABM是同三角形FGN的等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"773b036d8e20c9cf922d2a92df9a6ab8fea3eba3f14ba8b4ec990f54105c0690","citations":["euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as BM is to GN, so is BA to GF. [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BM比GN的比例相当于BA比GF；BM 与 GN 之比等于 BA 与 GF 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d919644ce20d89121942948a132f736fe2115d9cf538dd898fca4eae27bea58f","citations":["euclid-6-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the ratio of the square on BM to the square on GN is duplicate of the ratio of BM to GN, and the ratio of the polygon ABCDE to the polygon FGHKL is duplicate of the ratio of BA to GF; [[VI. 20](/principles/euclid-6-20)] therefore also, as the square on BM is to the square on GN, so is the polygon ABCDE to the polygon FGHKL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,BM对GN对正方形的比与GN对GN的比是重复的,多边形对ABCDE对多边形对多边形对FGHKL的比是重复的,BA对GF的比是重复的;因此,GN对BM对正方形的比相当于多边形对多边形对FGHKL的比。 [[VI. 20](/principles/euclid-6-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-1.source","contentId":"euclid-12-1","revisionId":"euclid-12-1@raw-ae9941b56cd1b573","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74a255f104d00a5dab2dc4746b9b76962654d6c65a1fda6014282ecff23adcbd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status"